\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\cf0\hich\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs22\lang1025\loch\f3\fs22\lang1033\qj\sb0\sa200{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
In the interest of intellectual honesty, several limitations and open questions are worth stating plainly rather than glossing over:}
\par \pard\plain \s29\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\cf0\hich\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs22\lang1025\loch\f3\fs22\lang1033{\listtext\pard\plain  \'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \li504\ri0\lin504\rin0\fi-288\sb0\sa100{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
The four-signal quality evaluator described in Section 3.3 is a reference design, not a validated psychometric instrument. Different deployments will likely need different or additional signals depending on domain.}
\par \pard\plain \s29\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\cf0\hich\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs22\lang1025\loch\f3\fs22\lang1033{\listtext\pard\plain  \'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \li504\ri0\lin504\rin0\fi-288\sb0\sa100{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
The specific numeric parameters given throughout this paper (0.1 / 0.05 reinforcement rates, 0.2 pruning floor, 2.0 strength cap, 0.65 extraction threshold, mirror_loop_interval of 3, 15% drift correction rate) were chosen during initial development and have not been subjected to formal ablation or optimization studies. They are reasonable starting points, not proven optima.}
\par \pard\plain \s29\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\cf0\hich\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs22\lang1025\loch\f3\fs22\lang1033{\listtext\pard\plain  \'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \li504\ri0\lin504\rin0\fi-288\sb0\sa100{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Keyword-based constraint extraction (Section 5.2) is a simple, interpretable approach, but it is also brittle: it will miss constraints implied by free text that does not use the specific trigger keywords, and it may occasionally extract spurious constraints from text that happens to contain those keywords incidentally.}
\par \pard\plain \s29\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\cf0\hich\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs22\lang1025\loch\f3\fs22\lang1033{\listtext\pard\plain  \'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \li504\ri0\lin504\rin0\fi-288\sb0\sa100{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Long-run stability of the constraint set and trait profile under sustained adversarial or out-of-distribution input has not been formally evaluated. Implementers deploying this in an adversarial context should add their own monitoring and bounds-checking beyond what is described here.}
